OL,3,GNEWSAReform UK hopes new group will
OL,4,Aattract women to party
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite having two female MPs, a
OL,7,Fregional mayor and hundreds of women
OL,8,Fcouncillors, Reform UK is still
OL,9,Fbattling a perception it is not a party
OL,10,Fpopular with women.
OL,12,FA YouGov poll released in July found a
OL,13,Fgender gap in voting intentions, with
OL,14,Fmen more likely to choose the party led
OL,15,Fby Nigel Farage than women.
OL,17,FThe other four main parties -
OL,18,FConservative, Labour, Liberal Democrats
OL,19,Fand Greens -were attracting a higher or
OL,20,Fequal proportion of women than men.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
